<title>UK: Dail Mail pre-exceptional profits up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Dail Mail pre-exceptional profits up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)adjusted    57.4		   vs 51.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 14.8		   vs 13.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 19.4		   vs 17.8</p>
<p> Pretax preexceps	 86.6		   vs 80.0</p>
